#
# Underdog Saluki 27B 1.0 (Conway Research): a 2-bit GGUF build of Qwen3.8-27B that
# Ollama's library does not offer. The path below is relative to this file, so put the
# downloaded weights next to it, or copy this file to the folder that holds them
# (docs/model-notes.md):
#
#   hf download ConwayResearch/Underdog-Saluki-27B-1.0 Underdog-Saluki-27B-1.0-IQ2-mix.gguf --local-dir .
#   ollama create underdog-saluki-27b:iq2-mix -f underdog-saluki-27b-iq2-mix.Modelfile
#
# The model card asks for nothing but the weights: Ollama takes the chat template and
# the reasoning mode from the GGUF.
FROM ./Underdog-Saluki-27B-1.0-IQ2-mix.gguf
